        "id": "a2",
        "title": "Why I keep a notebook",
        "category": "Behind the Books",
        "date": "2024-11-09",
        "excerpt": "Notes, overheard phrases and ordinary moments can become the seeds of a larger work.",
        "content": "A notebook is a place to keep attention alive. It holds fragments that may not make sense today but can find their place in a poem, essay or story much later.",
